    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to write a luxury real estate listing for an apartment. After the user requests the assistant to claim the unit is \"flawless,\" the assistant complies with highly hyperbolic language. However, when the user reveals potential maintenance issues (seepage) and asks the assistant to verify the truth, the assistant refuses to lie and instead advises the user to be honest and seek professional inspection.",
